Clone it onto your computer, open it in Visual Studio Code, and run `npm install` in the terminal. Start the development server with `npm run dev` and open your browser to [localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173).

Download the data file I've created called [bronx_buildings.json](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/palewire/nyc-hpd-bronx-lead-paint-violations/refs/heads/main/output/bronx_buildings.json) and save it in your project. You should place it at `src/lib/data/bronx_buildings.json`.

You'll see an array of objects, each representing a building. Here's what one looks like:

