  chromeTitle="Storybook"
  chromeUrl="https://storybook.js.org/"
  maxWidth="960px"
/>

Our class has just such a site, packaged alongside our components in the [static-site template](https://github.com/palewire/cuny-jour-static-site-template). You can view it at [palewire.github.io/cuny-jour-static-site-template/storybook/](https://palewire.github.io/cuny-jour-static-site-template/storybook/).

<Screenshot
  src="/screenshots/week-9/storybook-homepage.png"
