The [`DatabaseHeader`](https://github.com/palewire/cuny-jour-static-site-template/blob/main/src/lib/components/DatabaseHeader.svelte) component is the first piece you want to use today. It renders a full-width hero banner designed for database pages, with props for a headline, a description, a byline, and a date.

<Screenshot
